== tvstatic | About 1% of Old TV Static Was Light From the Big Bang #shorts
top: 1% OF OLD TV STATIC WAS / *LIGHT FROM THE BIG BANG*
hook: And about 1 percent of the black-and-white static
say: जब पुराने TV पर कोई channel नहीं आता था, तो screen पर काली सफ़ेद झिलमिल आती थी। हम उसे बस शोर समझते थे। पर उस झिलमिल का लगभग एक percent हिस्सा, ब्रह्मांड के जन्म की रोशनी थी।
say_en: When an old TV found no channel, the screen filled with black-and-white static. We thought it was just noise. But about 1 percent of that static was light from the birth of the universe.
say_roman: Jab puraane TV par koi channel nahi aata tha, toh screen par kaali safed jhilmil aati thi. Hum use bas shor samajhte the. Par us jhilmil ka lagbhag 1 percent hissa, brahmaand ke janam ki roshni thi.
captions: shorts/captions.hinglish.md
suspense: It was not a fault
body: In New Jersey .. ...the echo of the Big Bang
body: That same light has been travelling .. The echo of the Big Bang on the TV
